  "description": "_“I like this actor, you know.”_\n\nYoonsang is cast in *After Mass*, a new drama from Nflix Korea. His character’s love interest is Jeong Dohwan, a brilliant actor from the independent film scene whom Yoonsang has secretly admired.\n\nBut when they finally meet, Dohwan turns out to be a man Yoonsang simply cannot get a read on...?!\nPlayful yet serious, kind yet rude, Dohwan is a free spirit who completely throws Yoonsang off balance, despite Yoonsang’s nickname of “Prince Alpha” and his tendency to fall in love at the drop of a hat.\n\nDohwan seems interested, yet never quite crosses the line.\nEven after acting as bitter rivals with him, Yoonsang finds himself asking him out on dates once the cameras stop rolling.\nHe plays Dohwan’s Omega, but in reality, pheromones have no effect on him.\nLove built on stubbornness and pride!\nWill he be able to win the heart of this seemingly unapproachable acting genius?\n\nHe may have a reputation as a Hollywood Casanova, but I’m definitely going to make him the one who can’t keep his composure!\n\n_Source: Ridibooks, translated_",
